// Vision (WP8.1, docs/rules/vision.md): the one number the simulation takes from here. How far each
// kind sees is `sight` in unit_defs.ron (cells); sf_bridge::vision_rules hands both to the world
// (World::with_vision). Placeholder for the balance rounds of phase 15.
(
    // The sight, in whole cells (0 to 64), of an entity that was not made from a unit table entry:
    // the placeholder wanderers of `--units` and the legacy `Place` structures. Real units and
    // structures use their own `sight`.
    legacy_sight_cells: 5,
)
